# =============================================================================
# .agentsignore  —  parental-os
# =============================================================================
# Mantiene a los agentes de codificación (Codex, Cursor, Claude, etc.) fuera
# del contenido del repo que no aporta a la tarea y solo quema tokens:
# arboles de build completos, worktrees, chroots, binarios, logs y caches.
#
# Sintaxis identica a .gitignore.
#   - Un patron que empieza con barra (/) se ancla a la raiz del repo.
#   - ** cruza cualquier numero de directorios.
#   - Un patron que termina en barra (/) solo aplica a directorios.
#
# Queda accesible a proposito (fuente de la verdad):
#   Justfile, compose.qemu.yml, .gitignore
#   docs/                 (incluido docs/superpowers/ plans/specs/handoffs)
#   overlays/             (config y scripts raiz del OS)
#   packages/             (PKGBUILD, debian/ — no su build)
#   scripts/ y scripts/lib/
#   tests/
# =============================================================================


# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 0. Lo mas caro: worktrees de git y arboles raiz completos de Linux.
#    .worktrees/ y out/ contienen raices generadas por live-build (Ubuntu) y
#    archiso (CachyOS): miles de archivos bajo etc/ var/ usr/ root/ ...
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
/.worktrees/
/out/
**/out/

# Sub-arboles tipicos de archiso / live-build (en cualquier worktree o build):
**/airootfs/
**/chroot/
**/bootstrap/
**/profile-work/

# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 1. Directorios de salida / build / cache (en cualquier nivel)
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
build/
work/
.build/
.cache/
dist/
artifacts/
_output/

# Build especifico por distro:
distros/**/cache/
distros/**/binary/
distros/**/.build/
distros/**/work/

# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 2. Artefactos binarios, imagenes y paquetes generados
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
*.iso
*.img
*.raw
*.qcow2
*.vdi
*.vmdk
*.vhd
*.deb
*.ddeb
*.rpm
*.pkg.tar.*
*.tar
*.tar.gz
*.tar.xz
*.tar.zst
*.zip
*.7z
*.squashfs
*.vmlinuz
*.initrd
*.efi
*.ko
*.o
*.a

# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 3. Python
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.pyo
*.pyd
.venv/
venv/
.mypy_cache/
.ruff_cache/
.pytest_cache/
.tox/

# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 4. Node / JS / TS  (por si entra tooling auxiliar)
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
node_modules/
.next/
.nuxt/
.parcel-cache/
.turbo/
*.min.js
*.min.css
*.js.map
*.css.map

# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 5. Lockfiles  (generados, pesados, bajo valor para razonar)
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
package-lock.json
pnpm-lock.yaml
yarn.lock
Pipfile.lock
poetry.lock
Cargo.lock
go.sum

# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 6. Logs, volcados y temporales
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
*.log
logs/
*.pid
*.seed
*.tmp
*.swp
*.swo
*~

# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 7. Basura de SO y editores / IDE
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
.idea/
.vscode/
*.code-workspace
.fleet/
.history/

# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 8. Build local de paquetes (Arch + Debian) — generado, no fuente.
#    La fuente de la verdad es overlays/; packages/*/src/ se sincroniza desde
#    ahi con scripts/sync-package-from-overlays.sh.
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
srcpkgs/
pkg/
packages/*/arch/pkg/
packages/*/arch/src/
packages/*/src/
packages/*/debian/*.debhelper*
packages/*/debian/.debhelper/
packages/*/debian/files
